---
description: Keep git history attributed only to the user
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits

- Never add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor/agent attribution to commits or PRs.
- Never use `git commit --trailer`.
- When creating commits, use plain `git commit -m` messages only.
- If attribution appears anyway, amend or rewrite the commit to remove it before pushing.
